WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.675
The question comes first: sales performance.

2
00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:08.635
Check the grain of the data and its definitions before you draw a chart or build a model.

3
00:00:09.035 --> 00:00:12.365
Start in Excel and reconcile revenue, target, and margin.

4
00:00:12.365 --> 00:00:19.786
Build explicit measures in Power BI, then use Tableau to compare regions and products without mixing incompatible definitions.

5
00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:23.461
Inspect an unusual movement in Jupyter and check its source.

6
00:00:23.461 --> 00:00:30.610
Bring the verified measures into Looker Studio, then use PowerPoint to explain what changed and which management decision follows.

7
00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.346
Publish the story as management scorecard.

8
00:00:33.346 --> 00:00:37.908
Let people filter the view, inspect the evidence, and understand the next action.

9
00:00:37.908 --> 00:00:41.858
The presentation should remain clear when the underlying data changes.
